[SKILLS_DESC.Scout]
The Scouting skill influences the soldier's camouflage and accuracy when using a sniper rifle.

[SKILLS_DESC.Gunlayer]
The Gunnery skill influences the soldier's accuracy when using large caliber guns.

[SKILLS_DESC.intelligence]
Intelligence influences how quickly the soldier gains experience.

[SKILLS_DESC.leadership]
Leadership influences the soldier’s morale.

[SKILLS_DESC.driver]
The Driving skill influences the soldier’s driving abilities.

[SKILLS_DESC.accuracy]
Marksmanship influences the soldier’s accuracy when using small arms and machineguns.

